// wave32:
//
//   - A (fp16): lane l holds row l%16, element e its column e.
//   - B (fp16): lane l holds column l%16, element e its row e.
//   - accumulators (fp32 and fp16): lane l holds column l%16, element e
//     its row 2e + l/16.
